              <section class="content">
                <p>
                  本頁面包含 3.32.0 的發行說明。
                  如需後續錯誤修正版本的資訊，
                  請參閱 Flutter <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">CHANGELOG</a>。
                </p>
                <div class="header-wrapper">
                  <h2 id="flutter-框架">Flutter 框架</h2>
                  <a class="heading-link" href="#flutter-框架" aria-label="Link to 'Flutter 框架' section">#</a>
                </div>
                <div class="header-wrapper">
                  <h3 id="framework">Framework</h3>
                  <a class="heading-link" href="#framework" aria-label="Link to 'Framework' section">#</a>
                </div>
                <ul>
                  <li>
                    Do not block vertical drag gestures in CupertinoSheetRoute body by @MitchellGoodwin in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/161696">161696</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make <code>PipelineOwner</code> a <code>base</code> class by @LongCatIsLooong in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/161789">161789</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] backfilling TextContents unit tests by @gaaclarke in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/161625">161625</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Fix documentation of Flow.clipBehavior by @mernen in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/161863">161863</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Roll pub packages by @flutter-pub-roller-bot in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/162015">162015</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
