                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Fix DropdownMenu example RenderFlex overflowed error by @huycozy in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/162558">162558</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Fixed translated text's subpixel alignment. by @gaaclarke in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/162824">162824</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Support CupertinoSliverNavigationBar.search with condensed large title by @victorsanni in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/159120">159120</a>
                  </li>
